{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34446","headline":"和袭美寒日书斋即事三首每篇各用一韵 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美寒日书斋即事三首每篇各用一韵 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不必探幽上郁冈，公斋吟啸亦何妨。\n唯求薏苡供僧食，别着氍毹待客牀。\n春近带烟分短蕙，晓来冲雪撼疎篁。\n余杭山酒犹封在，遥嘱高人未肯尝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}